    "sections": {
        "description": "Savalog is a modern, versatile, and responsive WordPress theme designed for bloggers, content creators, storytellers, writers, and journalists. It is a minimal, lightweight, and customizer-based theme for creating beautiful, fast-loading, and accessible websites. Whether you're blogging about lifestyle, health, business, DIY, photography, fashion, travel, or niche subjects, this theme is flexible and adapts to whatever you're passionate about. The theme is SEO optimized, ensures fast loading times, and includes intuitive customization options, and beautiful typography. Savalog is mobile-friendly and cross-browser compatible, looking great on all devices, computers, and screen sizes."
    },
